<title>RUSSIA: Seversky Trubny Russia 1996 pretax falls.</title>
<headline>Seversky Trubny Russia 1996 pretax falls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Seversky Trubny Zavod, (Seversky Tube Works), said on Tuesday 1996 pretax profit to Russian accruals accounting standards was 150.35 billion roubles after 200.87 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>A statement distributed at the annual meeting of the industrial pipemaker which supplies the oil industry said that the company would not pay out a dividend for 1996. In 1995, the dividend was 95 roubles per 5,000 rouble nominal share and an extra share for every 21 shares.</p>
</text>
